---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — Sett Agency"
  description="Terms governing your use of settagency.com, operated by Sett Agency."
>
  <main class="doc-main">
    <div class="doc-inner">

      <h1 class="doc-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="doc-meta">Last updated: 18 June 2026</p>

      <p>These terms govern your use of settagency.com, operated by Sett Agency, based in Sarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina.</p>

      <h2>Use of this website</h2>
      <p>This website is provided to give visitors information about Sett Agency's services, past work, and how to get in touch. You may browse and read the content freely. You may not copy, reproduce, or reuse our case studies, brand assets, images, or written content without our written permission.</p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>All content on this site, including case studies, images, brand identity work, and copy, is the property of Sett Agency or the respective clients featured, and is protected by copyright. Client work is shown with permission.</p>

      <h2>No warranties</h2>
      <p>We keep this website up to date to the best of our ability but make no guarantees that all information is complete, accurate, or current at all times.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>Sett Agency is not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of this website, to the extent permitted by law.</p>

      <h2>Working with us</h2>
      <p>These terms cover the website only. Any project we deliver for a client is governed by a separate agreement or proposal signed between Sett Agency and that client.</p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Bosnia and Herzegovina.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:hello@settagency.com">hello@settagency.com</a></p>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .doc-main {
    background: #F7F6F2;
    padding: clamp(80px, 12vw, 140px) clamp(24px, 6vw, 80px) clamp(80px, 10vw, 120px);
  }

  .doc-inner {
    max-width: 740px;
  }

  .doc-title {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: #111111;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .doc-meta {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #888888;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .doc-inner p {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #555555;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .doc-inner h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #111111;
    margin-top: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .doc-inner a {
    color: #111111;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: #BBBBBB;
    text-decoration-thickness: 0.5px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .doc-inner a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: #111111;
  }
</style>
